{"id":"sh/w3i1sfa9","kind":"textbox","name":"Illustrative everyday dialogue","position":{"left":66,"top":54,"width":550,"height":183},"text":"यार, आख़िरी ओवर में वो गेंद क्यों डाली? भारत को वहाँ कुछ और करना चाहिए था!","style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Nirmala UI","color":"#20201F","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"wedgeRoundRectCallout","fillColor":"#E2EBDF","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/9072xkry","kind":"textbox","name":"Illustrative everyday dialogue","position":{"left":669,"top":70,"width":543,"height":174},"text":"बचपन में तो हर खेल में अच्छा था… अब खेलने का टाइम ही नहीं मिलता!","style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Nirmala UI","color":"#20201F","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"wedgeRoundRectCallout","fillColor":"#E3EAEC","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/ozy1ofad","kind":"textbox","name":"Illustrative everyday dialogue","position":{"left":98,"top":286,"width":510,"height":177},"text":"काम में इतना उलझा रहा कि खबरें ही नहीं पढ़ पाया। आजकल चल क्या रहा है?","style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Nirmala UI","color":"#20201F","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"wedgeRoundRectCallout","fillColor":"#E3EAF0","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/b29kza94","kind":"textbox","name":"Illustrative everyday dialogue","position":{"left":661,"top":289,"width":551,"height":185},"text":"सुबह वाला सुविचार व्हाट्सऐप स्टेटस पर लगाया था। परिवार के ग्रुप में भी भेज दिया।","style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Nirmala UI","color":"#20201F","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"wedgeRoundRectCallout","fillColor":"#F3E6CD","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/a10jqpsj","kind":"textbox","name":"Illustrative everyday dialogue","position":{"left":307,"top":491,"width":682,"height":130},"text":"कोई सवाल अटक जाए, तो जवाब मिले बिना चैन नहीं पड़ता!","style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Nirmala UI","color":"#20201F","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"wedgeRoundRectCallout","fillColor":"#E9E3EF","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/x4r21kru","kind":"textbox","name":"रोज़मर्रा की बातें। यहीं से शुरू हुए खेलों के विचार।","position":{"left":64,"top":646,"width":1152,"height":45},"text":"रोज़मर्रा की बातें। यहीं से शुरू हुए खेलों के विचार।","style":{"fontSize":34,"typeface":"Nirmala UI","color":"#315A61","bold":true,"alignment":"center"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
